                     of copies in binary form.
                  &lt;/li&gt;
                  
&lt;li&gt;
                     &lt;var class="replaceable-license-text"&gt;&lt;span title="can be replaced with the pattern .{0,20}"&gt; *&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/var&gt;
                     The name of Fraunhofer may not be used to endorse or promote products derived
